<p class="whs9"><span lang="EN-US"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/menu.gif" width="304px" height="179px" border="0" class="img_whs10" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="middle" width="45.061%" class="whs11">
<p><a href="../Corrosion/overview_Corrosion.htm">Corrosion module</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs12">
<td width="45.061%" class="whs13">
<p><a href="#Macro_module_group">Macros module group</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Macro_module_group"></a>Macro module group</p>
<table width="804" cellspacing="0" class="whs14">
<col class="whs15">
<col class="whs16">
<col class="whs17">
<tr valign="top" class="whs18">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="21.104%" class="whs19">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="70.314%" class="whs20">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="4.125%" class="whs21">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs18">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="21.104%" class="whs22">
<p class="normal-table-func">Save Selected Script</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="70.314%" class="whs23">
<p class="normal-table">Saves the selected script in text file. The default file name is <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>CommandLineLog.txt</i></span>.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs18">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="21.104%" class="whs22">
<p class="normal-table-func">Run Script from File</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="70.314%" class="whs23">
<p class="normal-table">Executes loaded sequence of operations (script) on a single or multiple files.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../Macros/Macros_Menu/run_script_from_file.htm"><img src="../Macros/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs25" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs18">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="21.104%" class="whs22">
<p class="normal-table-func">Enable Logging</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="70.314%" class="whs23">
<p class="normal-table">This command enables/disables storing commands in log window and file.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../Macros/Macros_Menu/enable_logging.htm"><img src="../Macros/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs25" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs18">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="21.104%" class="whs22">
<p class="normal-table-func">Clear</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="70.314%" class="whs23">
<p class="normal-table">Clears the contents of the Command Window.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs18">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="21.104%" class="whs22">
<p class="normal-table-func">Show Command Window</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="70.314%" class="whs23">
<p class="normal-table">This command is used to show/hide the command window</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../Macros/Macros_Menu/show_command_window.htm"><img src="../Macros/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs25" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs18">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="21.104%" class="whs22">
<p class="normal-table-func">Dock</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="70.314%" class="whs23">
<p class="normal-table">Docks/undocks the Command Window to the KUBE application window.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>When right-click in the Command Window a context menu appears with the same commands as in the Macro Menu. In addition there are some text manipulation commands like: <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Select all</b></span> (selects the contents of Command Window), <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Copy selected</b></span> (copies the selected text to Windows clipboard), and <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Copy all</b></span> (copies the whole contents of Command Window to Windows clipboard).</p>
<p><img src="../Macros/Images/Context_menu.gif" width="197px" height="202px" border="0" class="img_whs26" alt=""></p>
